      "source": [
        "## 9. Forward feature selection with preprocessing inside every CV fold\n",
        "Select **10 raw predictors**, retaining all encoded categories of each selected predictor.\n",
        "This differs from the original selection of 10 already-transformed columns.\n",
        "\n",
        "For every candidate subset, a fresh preprocessing + Decision Tree pipeline is evaluated\n",
        "with three stratified folds **within the fitting set only**. Each fold learns its own\n",
        "imputation, scaling and encoding. The best mean claim F1 determines the next feature.\n",
        "These CV scores guide selection and are not an unbiased final performance estimate.\n",
        "The selected raw features are then used in a separate Random Forest pipeline.\n"
      ]
    },
